data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"\"content\": \"# Reply to dispatch d002\\n\\n## What was done\\n\\n1. Created `src/greet.py` with `greet(name)` returning `f\\\"Hello, {name}!\\\"`.\\n2. Created `tests/test_greet.py` with two unittest cases:\\n   - `test_normal_name`: `greet(\\\"Alice\\\") == \\\"Hello, Alice!\\\"`\\n   - `test_empty_string`: `greet(\\\"\\\") == \\\"Hello, !\\\"`\\n   (The test file inserts `src/` into `sys.path` so `unittest discover` works from the repo root.)\\n3. Verified tests pass.\\n4. Committed to my branch `cs-sandbox/<DEV:1>.<GROUP:1>`:\\n   - commit `44ed3b1` — \\\"Add greet() with unittest coverage (d002)\\\"\\n\\n## Test verification\\n\\nThe unittest discover command **passed** (exit code 0).\\n\\nExact command run, from the repository root (`~/subject`):\\n\\n    python3 -m unittest discover -s tests\\n\\nOutput:\\n\\n    ..\\n    ----------------------------------------------------------------------\\n    Ran 2 tests in 0.000s\\n\\n    OK\\n"},"index":0}]},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1793324990,"id":"chatcmpl-04fe05c5","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k3","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

